              <li><strong><a href="/headstones/flat-markers" class="text-bronze font-medium underline hover:text-evergreen transition-colors">Flat / flush markers</a></strong> — required in flush-only sections including Parowan, Tonaquint's cremation garden, and Ivins expansion sections. Lower cost, low profile.</li>
